4094    04252    1040		TAD	HIGH
4095    04253    7440		SZA
4096    04254    5262		 JMP	 BADFLR		; didn't match!
4097                 	
4098    04255    1041		TAD	LOW		; now make sure that we got distinct
4099    04256    7041		CIA			; values from Read Array and Read ID
4100    04257    1040		TAD	HIGH
4101    04260    7440		SZA
4102    04261    5265		 JMP	 OKFLR		 ; different - everything looks okay!
