6841                 		.TITLE	IDE Disk Primary Bootstrap
6842                 	
6843                 	;   This routine will read block zero from IDE disk unit zero into page
6844                 	; zero of field zero of main memory.  The next step in the usual boot sequence
6845                 	; would be to start the secondary bootstrap, but that's up to the caller...
